        <mxCell id="c80" value="ARI SEES: Your place in &quot;Build a tiny game&quot; is reserved. Confirmation email is unavailable. Your reservation is still saved.&#10;AFTER: reservations {S21, S22, S23}; W17 unchanged; 0 remaining. A refresh via Board Queries returns the stored S23 seat.&#10;A repeat Reserve returns Existing(R-W17-S23), unchanged, even though full; no additional email request.&#10;University Mail failure changes neither the saved seat nor the success result; no automatic retries." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#e4f4ed;strokeColor=#506176;fontColor=#172b42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
